<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" class="h-full">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>文献人工代查 - 2小时内发邮箱 · 100%正版高清PDF原件</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS & Lucide Icons (优先加载本地静态包，彻底解决国内网络CDN加载超时问题) -->
  <script src="assets/tailwind.min.js"></script>
  <script src="assets/lucide.min.js"></script>
  <!-- 容灾备用 CDN -->
  <script>
    if (typeof tailwind === 'undefined') {
      document.write('<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@2.2.19/dist/tailwind.min.js"><\/script>');
    }
    if (typeof lucide === 'undefined') {
      document.write('<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide@latest/dist/umd/lucide.min.js"><\/script>');
    }
  </script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            apple: {
              bg: '#F5F5F7',
              card: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88)',
              ink: '#1D1D1F',
              sub: '#6E6E73',
              border: 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)',
              accent: '#0071E3',
              hover: '#0077ED'
            }
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['-apple-system', 'BlinkMacSystemFont', '"SF Pro Text"', '"SF Pro Display"', '"PingFang SC"', '"Hiragino Sans GB"', '"Segoe UI"', 'Roboto', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['"SF Mono"', 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Consolas', 'monospace']
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    /* Apple 原生精致感与毛玻璃拟态规范 (Glassmorphism & Apple HIG) */
    * {
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #F5F5F7;
      color: #1D1D1F;
      font-feature-settings: "cv02", "cv03", "cv04", "cv11";
    }
    .tabular-nums {
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .apple-glass {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    }
    .apple-glass-card {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      transition: all 0.36s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
    }
    
    /* Apple 拟物理弹簧手感 (Spring Physics) */
    .spring-press {
      transition: transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), background-color 0.18s ease;
    }
    .spring-press:active {
      transform: scale(0.972);
      transition: transform 0.1s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
    }

    /* 选项卡与卡片悬浮弹簧 */
    .spring-card {
      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }
    .spring-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1.5px);
    }
    .spring-card:active {
      transform: scale(0.985);
    }

    /* 界面平滑弹簧入场动效 */
    @keyframes appleSpringIn {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.985);
      }
      65% {
        transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.004);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }
    }
    .anim-spring-in {
      animation: appleSpringIn 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1) forwards;
    }

    /* 胶囊滑动背景过渡 */
    .spring-tab-transition {
      transition: all 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.4, 0.64, 1);
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 5px;
      height: 5px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      border-radius: 999px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-full flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-black selection:text-white pb-12">

  <!-- 顶部导航 (品牌Logo与极简排版) -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 bg-[#F5F5F7]/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-black/[0.05]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-14 flex items-center justify-between">
      <!-- 品牌Logo与文字 -->
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
        <img src="assets/logo.jpg" alt="Logo" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg object-cover border border-black/10 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2">
          <span class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-apple-ink">AAA人工文献库</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-apple-sub font-normal hidden sm:inline">已在工位 · 2小时内发邮箱</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右侧辅助按钮 -->
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs">
        <button onclick="openContactModal()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium text-apple-ink hover:bg-black/[0.04] transition-colors flex items-center">
          <i data-lucide="message-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-emerald-600"></i>
          <span>微信客服</span>
        </button>
        <button onclick="scrollToTrack()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium text-apple-sub hover:text-apple-ink hover:bg-black/[0.04] transition-colors flex items-center">
          <i data-lucide="search" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1"></i>
          <span>查进度</span>
        </button>
        <button onclick="openShareModal()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500/15 transition-colors flex items-center">
          <i data-lucide="gift" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-emerald-600"></i>
          <span>邀请免费再查1篇</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 主体内容 -->
  <main class="flex-grow max-w-4xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-6 sm:pt-8 space-y-6">

    <!-- 顶部状态与人情味公告 (字少、真诚、朴实) -->
    <section class="apple-glass-card p-6 sm:p-7 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="max-w-xl space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            <span>服务时间：每日 08:00 – 凌晨 01:00 在线</span>
          </div>
          
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-apple-ink">
            AAA人工文献库 · 2小时内发邮箱
          </h1>

          <p class="text-sm text-apple-sub leading-relaxed font-normal">
            已在工位，纯人工检索！啥都不赚，就赚点通宵整理文献的辛苦跑腿钱。100% 官方数据库正版高清 PDF，下不到全额退。
          </p>

          <!-- 极简活动标签 -->
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-black/[0.04] text-apple-ink font-medium">新客首篇免费试用</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-black/[0.04] text-apple-ink font-medium">邀请好友双方各免1篇</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-black/[0.04] text-apple-ink font-medium">承诺2小时内直达</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 专属 Logo 形象展示卡片 (已在工位·顶刊环绕卡皮巴拉) -->
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/10 shadow-sm relative group bg-white">
          <img src="assets/logo.jpg" alt="AAA人工文献库 Logo" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm text-[10px] text-white text-center py-0.5 font-bold">
            已在工位
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 权威学术数据库覆盖矩阵 (高校账号全权限 · 100% 正版高清原件) -->
    <section class="apple-glass-card p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-black/[0.05] pb-3">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600"></i>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-apple-ink">高校图书馆账号覆盖数据库权限 (100% 官方原版直通)</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-medium text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full flex items-center">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mr-1.5"></span>
          权限全部在线
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
        
        <!-- 综合顶刊集群 -->
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/[0.05] space-y-1.5 spring-card">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-apple-sub flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>综合三大顶刊及预印本</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-mono">100%原件</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">Nature 全系子刊</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">Science (AAAS)</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">Cell Press</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">PNAS</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 理工与计算机集群 -->
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/[0.05] space-y-1.5 spring-card">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-apple-sub flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>理工与计算机核心库</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-mono">全库下载</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">IEEE Xplore</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">ScienceDirect (Elsevier)</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">SpringerLink</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">Wiley</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">ACM DL</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 生化环材与医学集群 -->
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/[0.05] space-y-1.5 spring-card">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-apple-sub flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>生化环材与生物医学</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-mono">高影响因子</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">PubMed / MEDLINE</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">ACS (美国化学会)</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">RSC 皇家化学</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">The Lancet (柳叶刀)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 社科、经管与引文索引 -->
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/[0.05] space-y-1.5 spring-card">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-apple-sub flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>经管社科与权威引文库</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-mono">SCI/SSCI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">Web of Science</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">Scopus</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">Emerald Insight (商科)</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">JSTOR</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">Taylor & Francis</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 中文顶流全库 -->
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/[0.05] space-y-1.5 spring-card sm:col-span-2">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-apple-sub flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>中文官方正版全库 (知网 / 万方 / 维普 / 硕博论文)</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-mono">100% 覆盖</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">中国知网 (CNKI 全学术期刊)</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-bold text-apple-ink">全国硕士/博士学位论文库</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">万方数据知识平台</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">维普中文科技期刊</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white border border-black/10 font-medium text-apple-ink">国家图书馆电子资源直连</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 核心表单与智能算价卡片 -->
    <section class="apple-glass-card p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-6">
      
      <!-- 服务类型选择 (精确代查 vs 关键词代找) -->
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-apple-sub mb-2.5">请选择代查方式</div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 p-1.5 bg-black/[0.04] rounded-2xl text-xs font-semibold">
          <button type="button" id="tab-doi" onclick="switchMode('doi')" class="py-2.5 px-3 rounded-xl bg-black text-white shadow-sm spring-tab-transition spring-press flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 font-bold cursor-pointer">
            <i data-lucide="file-text" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
            <span>精准代查 (限DOI/官方链接)</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="tab-kw" onclick="switchMode('keyword')" class="py-2.5 px-3 rounded-xl text-apple-sub hover:text-apple-ink spring-tab-transition spring-press flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 font-medium cursor-pointer">
            <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
            <span>关键词代找 (按方向/要求筛选)</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 模式 A：精准代查 -->
      <div id="section-mode-doi" class="space-y-4 anim-spring-in">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-apple-sub">语种与单价</span>
            <span id="badge-doi-lang-hint" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-medium">当前已选：英文 2元/篇</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div id="lbl-doi-en" onclick="selectDoiLang('en')" class="cursor-pointer border-2 border-black bg-black/[0.02] p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between spring-card shadow-sm transition-all relative">
              <input type="radio" id="radio-doi-en" name="doi_lang" value="en" checked class="hidden">
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-ink flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span>英文外文文献</span>
                  <span id="tag-doi-en" class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-black text-white rounded font-normal">已选</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub">高校官方数据库高清原件</div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-apple-ink">¥2.0</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-apple-sub">/篇</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div id="lbl-doi-cn" onclick="selectDoiLang('cn')" class="cursor-pointer border border-black/10 hover:border-black/20 p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between spring-card transition-all relative">
              <input type="radio" id="radio-doi-cn" name="doi_lang" value="cn" class="hidden">
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-ink flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span>中文学术文献</span>
                  <span id="tag-doi-cn" class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-black text-white rounded font-normal hidden">已选</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub">知网/万方全库/博硕士论文</div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-apple-ink">¥1.0</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-apple-sub">/篇</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 篇数控制 -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-black/[0.02] rounded-xl border border-black/[0.05]">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-ink">代查篇数：</span>
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <button type="button" onclick="changeDoiCount(-1)" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-apple-ink btn-press cursor-pointer">-</button>
            <span id="txt-doi-count" class="font-mono font-bold text-sm w-5 text-center">1</span>
            <button type="button" onclick="changeDoiCount(1)" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-apple-ink btn-press cursor-pointer">+</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 文献内容输入 (精准代查严格限制只收 DOI 或官方链接) -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
            <label for="input-doi-content" class="text-xs font-semibold text-apple-ink">
              文献 DOI 标识 或 官方文章链接 <span class="text-red-500">* (精准代查只认 DOI)</span>
            </label>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-700 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-medium">严禁发纯标题/发AI虚拟题目</span>
          </div>
          <textarea id="input-doi-content" rows="3" placeholder="仅限输入 DOI（例如：10.1016/j.cell.2023.08.012）或官方论文直达网址。多篇请换行。
※ 若您手上只有中文/英文论文题目或关键词，请点击上方切换到【关键词代找】模式！" class="w-full text-xs font-mono p-3 bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/10 rounded-xl focus:border-black focus:bg-white outline-none transition-all placeholder:text-apple-sub/50"></textarea>
          <div class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-sub flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>※ DOI 通常以 10. 开头，提供 DOI 能确保 100% 秒下官方正版超清原件。</span>
            <button type="button" onclick="switchMode('keyword')" class="text-apple-accent hover:underline text-[11px] font-medium cursor-pointer">没有DOI？转关键词代找 →</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 模式 B：关键词代找 -->
      <div id="section-mode-kw" class="space-y-4 hidden">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-apple-sub">语种基础价</span>
            <span id="badge-kw-lang-hint" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-medium">当前已选：英文 3元起/篇</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div id="lbl-kw-en" onclick="selectKwLang('en')" class="cursor-pointer border-2 border-black bg-black/[0.02] p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between spring-card shadow-sm transition-all relative">
              <input type="radio" id="radio-kw-en" name="kw_lang" value="en" checked class="hidden">
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-ink flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span>英文关键词代找</span>
                  <span id="tag-kw-en" class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-black text-white rounded font-normal">已选</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub">SCI / 顶刊 / Web of Science</div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-apple-ink">¥3.0</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-apple-sub">起/篇</span>
