                </label>
                <span class="text-[10px] bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-700 font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-rose-200">
                  晚了不收费 · 超时全额退
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub leading-relaxed mt-1">
                无论我是在<strong class="text-apple-ink font-semibold">洗澡、干饭、还是看电影</strong>，手机收到加急单立马擦干手拔掉耳机滚到电脑前检索回复！
                <span class="text-rose-600 font-semibold">承诺 25 分钟内必定发送至邮箱，超时一秒直接全额退款不收钱！</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black text-rose-600 font-mono">+¥2.00</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 搞笑猫猫表情包条目 -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 p-2.5 bg-black/[0.02] rounded-xl border border-black/[0.06]">
          <img src="assets/urgent_meme.jpg" alt="你好很高兴为你服务" class="w-14 h-14 object-contain rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub leading-snug">
            <div class="font-bold text-apple-ink">专员真实在线心理活动：</div>
            <div class="text-apple-sub/90 mt-0.5">“你好，很高兴为你服务（耳机已戴好，双手正疯狂敲键盘中...）”</div>
          </div>
        </div>
