            <span class="text-[10px] text-apple-sub ml-1">人工直发邮箱 · 下不到全额退</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-ink">¥</span>
            <span id="txt-final-price" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-apple-ink tabular-nums">2.00</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 支付与人工发货流程 (纯人工直发邮箱，绝无网盘与云盘套路) -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        
        <!-- 扫码支付区域 (先付后查) -->
        <div id="section-payment" class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-white space-y-3 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-black/[0.06] pb-2.5">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-ink">第二步：扫码直接付款 (先付后查)</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">2小时内附件发邮箱</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub mt-0.5">使用微信或支付宝扫描下方收款码转账实付金额</div>
