            <div class="flex p-0.5 bg-black/[0.05] rounded-xl text-xs font-bold">
              <button type="button" onclick="setPayMethod('wechat')" id="btn-pay-wx" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black text-white shadow-sm spring-tab-transition spring-press cursor-pointer font-bold">微信支付</button>
              <button type="button" onclick="setPayMethod('alipay')" id="btn-pay-ali" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-apple-sub hover:text-black spring-tab-transition spring-press cursor-pointer font-medium">支付宝</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 真实收款码展示长图 (清晰居中，手机支持长按保存) -->
          <div id="box-qr-wrapper" class="w-52 sm:w-60 mx-auto p-2 bg-black/[0.02] rounded-xl border border-black/10 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center relative">
            <img id="img-pay-qr" src="assets/wechat_pay.jpg" alt="真实收款码" class="w-full h-auto object-contain rounded-lg">
          </div>

          <div id="tip-pay-qr" class="text-center text-[11px] text-apple-sub leading-relaxed">
            手机端可截屏或长按保存后扫码付款 · 扫码付款后输入付款凭证提交即可
          </div>

          <!-- 自动化授权激活码专区 (系统自动生成专属Key · 自动核对 · 无需人工客服) -->
          <div id="box-license-key" class="pt-3 border-t border-black/[0.06] space-y-2.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <label for="input-license-key" class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-ink flex items-center">
                <i data-lucide="key-round" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-apple-ink"></i>
                <span>系统自动生成激活码 (专属 License Key)</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold ml-1">● 自动核验</span>
              </label>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <button type="button" onclick="autoGenerateNewKey(true)" class="text-[10px] text-apple-sub hover:text-black underline cursor-pointer">重新生成Key</button>
                <span id="badge-key-status" class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">✓ 专属Key已自动就绪</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <input type="text" id="input-license-key" oninput="onKeyInputTrigger()" placeholder="系统自动生成专属 Key" class="flex-grow text-xs px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/10 rounded-xl focus:border-black focus:bg-white outline-none font-mono uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-apple-ink">
              <button type="button" onclick="verifyLicenseKey()" id="btn-verify-key" class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-black hover:bg-black/85 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl btn-press whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-1">
                <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                <span>直接核对Key</span>
              </button>
            </div>

            <!-- 全自动化说明卡片 (完全不找客服，后台自动发货) -->
            <div id="box-key-result" class="text-xs p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/[0.04] text-emerald-900 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span id="txt-key-msg" class="leading-relaxed font-medium">
                  ⚡ 系统已为您自动分配专属激活码并直接绑定。扫码付款后直接点击下方提单，无需联系客服，专员后台查到文献后直接发送至您的邮箱！
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-apple-sub border-t border-black/[0.04] pt-1 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>扫码付款 ➔ 系统自动核对激活码 ➔ 后台专员直接发货至邮箱</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">免客服繁琐沟通 · 全程自动化</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 极简特别说明 (字极少、杜绝扯皮) -->
        <div class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub leading-relaxed space-y-1 px-1">
          <div>· 承诺 2 小时内将 100% 官方正版超清 PDF 原件直接发至您的邮箱 (若勾选加急则 25 分钟极速直达)（每日 08:00 – 凌晨 01:00 在线）。</div>
          <div>· 无需任何第三方网盘下载，原件作为邮件附件直达，永久留存不失效。</div>
          <div>· 提单后直连推送至专员 Gmail 工作邮箱（chinareferencehelper@gmail.com）即刻触发提醒。</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 确认付款并提交工单直发邮箱按钮 -->
        <button type="button" id="btn-submit-order" onclick="submitClientOrder()" class="w-full py-4 bg-black hover:bg-black/90 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl btn-press shadow-md flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 cursor-pointer transition-all">
          <i data-lucide="mail-check" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
          <span id="txt-submit-btn">我已扫码付款，直接核对激活码并下达工单 (2小时内发邮箱)</span>
        </button>

        <div id="submit-loading-tip" class="hidden text-center text-xs text-apple-sub flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 py-1">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 border-2 border-black border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"></span>
          <span>正在将工单直连推送至专员 Gmail 邮箱并派发人工检索...</span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- 客户进度自查专区 (纯粹对客) -->
    <section id="section-track" class="apple-glass-card p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-apple-ink flex items-center">
          <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5 text-apple-sub"></i>
          <span>工单交付进度查询</span>
        </h2>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-apple-sub">输入提单邮箱即可自查</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <input type="text" id="query-email-input" placeholder="输入您提单时填写的邮箱 或 订单号" class="flex-grow text-xs px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/10 rounded-xl focus:border-black focus:bg-white outline-none font-mono">
        <button type="button" onclick="queryOrderStatus()" class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl btn-press">
